{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S10、S12等短停留段仍有较多常驻感受词，容易增加扫读负担，而且少数心理转折被压缩，X在叙事交代上更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词建立了清楚的叙事抓手，感受词又能随音乐进程出现，观众不必逐字读完也能抓住情绪变化。它对声音、动作、身体反应和音乐主题回返的描写明显更具体，尤其能让人感到前后情绪如何转化、如何呼应。X的完整叙述在解释人物心理动机和交代转折原因方面略胜一筹，但综合听觉同步、扫读效率和感受细腻度，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55df10f0-2431-4409-b479-32923f2b773e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T201028025830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:11:40.066295+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f51ffe8cc61c151f522e13972cee2133c980092b942f10206929f3dd5d81ceb9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee